      "start_seconds": 7.68,
      "end_seconds": 11.56,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.2,
      "end_seconds": 16.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "so I've been forgetting recent things doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.59,
      "end_seconds": 20.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "alright, how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 22.24,
      "end_seconds": 30.41,
      "duration_seconds": 8.17,
      "text": "I've had it for about a month. And And I've been getting lost on familiar roads as well"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.4,
      "end_seconds": 45.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.19,
      "text": "has there been any weakness on one side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.0,
      "end_seconds": 51.23,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "no, I haven't had any weakness on one side"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.97,
      "end_seconds": 56.45,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "have you had any bladder problems, hallucinations or headache?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.47,
      "end_seconds": 62.12,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "I haven't had bladder problems, hallucinations or headache, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.42,
      "end_seconds": 68.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "how are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.56,
      "end_seconds": 71.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "no, joints are fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.74,
      "end_seconds": 77.76,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "anything on the the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.72,
      "end_seconds": 79.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.04,
      "text": "skin's normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.62,
      "end_seconds": 85.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "alright, what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.09,
      "end_seconds": 90.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.36,
      "end_seconds": 95.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.76,
      "end_seconds": 100.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "I've, I've got high blood pressure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.08,
      "end_seconds": 105.76,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Okay, go on. Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 106.9,
      "end_seconds": 109.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 117.82,
      "end_seconds": 122.72,
      "duration_seconds": 4.9,
      "text": "tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 123.51,
      "end_seconds": 137.24,
      "duration_seconds": 13.73,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring. I grab fast food at lunch most days. I do a yoga class on Thursdays. I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.23,
      "end_seconds": 142.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "okay what operations have you had if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.22,
      "end_seconds": 159.22,
      "duration_seconds": 12.0,
      "text": "Yes, I had my septum straightened, in my thirties. A A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.11,
      "end_seconds": 164.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.12,
      "end_seconds": 173.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.12,
      "text": "Alright, keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 193.4,
      "end_seconds": 200.42,
      "duration_seconds": 7.02,
      "text": "okay: pulse 67, oxygen saturation is 97 percent, BP is 115 over 71, respiratory rate 18."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.97,
      "end_seconds": 206.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now, if that's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.16,
      "end_seconds": 209.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.15,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 210.25,
      "end_seconds": 212.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.53,
      "end_seconds": 230.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.16,
      "text": "the memory test score is a little low today and the rest of the neurological check is normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 231.52,
      "end_seconds": 233.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "yeah, no problem"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.76,
      "end_seconds": 249.41,
      "duration_seconds": 11.65,
      "text": "that's all I needed to check so where does that leave us? It It fits best with a gradual memory problem that needs further assessment"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.1,
      "end_seconds": 253.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "is this serious doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.26,
      "end_seconds": 264.71,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with a gradual memory problem that needs further assessment do well once it's treated properly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.57,
      "end_seconds": 286.66,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "Let's book a memory test to look into memory loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 287.86,
      "end_seconds": 290.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "The earliest is Wednesday 9 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 293.78,
      "end_seconds": 294.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.05,
      "text": "that's fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.81,
      "end_seconds": 323.6,
      "duration_seconds": 26.79,
      "text": "I'm going to order a brain scan, for memory loss. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed. Keep a a daily routine and write things down, a notebook by the door works well. We'll refer you to the older adults' assessment service. Let's review you in six weeks. Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 325.32,
      "end_seconds": 327.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "thank you, doctor, goodbye"
    }
